{"thread":{"threadID":3128,"boardID":166,"topic":"Mapvorschläge","time":1446646749,"userID":1812,"username":"Mike","lastPostTime":1448042001,"lastPoster":"Bara","replies":16,"views":1303,"attachments":0,"isSticky":0,"isClosed":0,"cumulativeLikes":3},"tags":[],"posts":[{"postID":40069,"threadID":3128,"userID":1812,"username":"Mike","subject":"Mapvorschläge","time":1446646749,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":3,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1952,"username":"Senpai","time":1446647023,"value":1},{"userID":1836,"username":"ApicNexie","time":1446651380,"value":1},{"userID":1789,"username":"Campelele","time":1446665224,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Hey Leute, war jetzt mal auf nem anderen TTT Server und hab da mal maps abgestaubt...</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Hätte gerne <a href=\"http://www40.zippyshare.com/v/JduchSxE/file.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">diese Maps</a>  auf dem Server...</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":40070,"threadID":3128,"userID":1952,"username":"Senpai","subject":"","time":1446647018,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":2,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1789,"username":"Campelele","time":1446665220,"value":1},{"userID":1958,"username":"Guenter_VI","time":1446668182,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Mir fehlt diese eine Flugzeug Map ka wie die heißt <span class=\"missing-media\">[^^]</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":40086,"threadID":3128,"userID":1812,"username":"Mike","subject":"","time":1446668131,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1958,"username":"Guenter_VI","time":1446668212,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Folgende Maps wären ggf auch geeignet... (Hab bisher nur die Screens angeschaut, müssten halt vorher mal getestet werden)</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><a href=\"http://gmod.gamebanana.com/maps/172576\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"></a><br><a href=\"http://gmod.gamebanana.com/maps/174649\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"></a><br><a href=\"http://gmod.gamebanana.com/maps/171761\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"></a> &lt;---- UNBEDINGT PLS<br><a href=\"http://gmod.gamebanana.com/maps/171503\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"></a><br><a href=\"http://gmod.gamebanana.com/maps/174767\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"></a> &lt;---- UNBEDINGT PLS<br><a href=\"http://csgo.gamebanana.com/maps/183275\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"></a><br><a href=\"http://gmod.gamebanana.com/maps/173700\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"></a><br><a href=\"http://gmod.gamebanana.com/maps/162521\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"></a></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Man muss halt mal schauen ob die GMOD maps kompatibel sind... Müssten sie aber eigentlich..</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":40087,"threadID":3128,"userID":1789,"username":"Campelele","subject":"","time":1446669199,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1958,"username":"Guenter_VI","time":1446669836,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Ich weiß nicht ob die beim Download dabei ist aber &quot;Rooftops&quot; war in Gmod immer ziemlich cool</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":40088,"threadID":3128,"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","subject":"","time":1446672226,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p><a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1812-mike/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Mike</a><br>GMOD Maps sind leider nicht kompatibel. Deswegen scheiden alle deine Maps, bis auf eine, aus.  <span class=\"archive-emoji\">🙁</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":40089,"threadID":3128,"userID":1958,"username":"Guenter_VI","subject":"","time":1446675902,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Es gibt doch bestimmt ne CS Version von Rooftops oder?</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":40090,"threadID":3128,"userID":1836,"username":"ApicNexie","subject":"","time":1446679690,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Auf dem alten TTT-Server gab es viele von den Gmod-Maps, unter anderem Rooftops, Teenroom, eine weitere (bessere) Slendermap sowie eine Karte mit 2 Ebenen und einem Bauernhof.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":40091,"threadID":3128,"userID":1758,"username":"Sexy Vengeance","subject":"","time":1446680061,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1958,"username":"Guenter_VI","time":1446711868,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p><a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1958-guenter-vi/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Guenter_VI</a>, die gibt es aktuell nicht. Ein bekannter Name der fällt wenn man GMOD-to-CSGO-ports erwähnt<br>sind slayers gaming oder so etwas. Sollten Maps aus GMOD geportet sein, sind sie oft am &quot;_slayers&quot; im Mapnamen erkennbar. Eventuell könnte man die naben ja mal kontaktieren, ob so etwas in Arbeit ist. Man weiß es ja nicht</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":40104,"threadID":3128,"userID":1812,"username":"Mike","subject":"","time":1446714894,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Die ersten beiden aus dem ersten post sind csgo maps.,.. hab die auch von nem csgo server.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Ich schau mal ob man was mit hammer machen kann</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":40105,"threadID":3128,"userID":1841,"username":"Max <3","subject":"","time":1446715082,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1958,"username":"Guenter_VI","time":1446715355,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Wäre cool wenn sich Teenroom und evtl. noch Bowlingalley finden lassen würden.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":40107,"threadID":3128,"userID":54,"username":"Craxto","subject":"","time":1446715945,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Man könnte ja mal in seinem CSGO Ordner anchgucken. Ich wette Apic hat die ganzen alten Maps noch rum liegen. Hab leider Pc resetted beim Win10 update und somit die alten Maps nicht mehr.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":40161,"threadID":3128,"userID":1812,"username":"Mike","subject":"","time":1446747455,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Jo,</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>suche grade von anderen Servern maps zusammen..</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Geht das denn überhaupt klar?</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Nicht, dass ich mir wieder unnütz Mühe mache so wie mit den Jail Regeln? <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1-sky/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Sky</a></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":40162,"threadID":3128,"userID":1758,"username":"Sexy Vengeance","subject":"","time":1446748182,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p><a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1812-mike/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Mike</a> ich glaube nicht, Sky wird dir den Kopf abreißen, wenn du ihm gute Maps für seine Server vorlegst.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Mach weiter <span class=\"archive-emoji\">🙂</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":40535,"threadID":3128,"userID":1812,"username":"Mike","subject":"","time":1447614367,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Hey, ich weiß jetzt wies geht. Hat jemand GMOD und würde mir das über &quot;family share&quot; teilen ODER mir die core dateien (models, textures etc) schicken? Ohne gehts leider nicht...</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Außer jemand würde mir GMOD donaten...</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":40556,"threadID":3128,"userID":1379,"username":"Jomep","subject":"","time":1447679981,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Ich weiß nicht, welche Maps gerade auf dem Server sind, in meinem Ordner habe ich <a href=\"http://imgur.com/dx5h7eo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"></a> und kann die auch hochladen.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":40558,"threadID":3128,"userID":54,"username":"Craxto","subject":"","time":1447683681,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Crummycradle und Magma fehlen soweit ich weiss. Ty Jomep &lt;3. Lad die am Besten im Ts Up&amp;Download Channel hoch.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":40797,"threadID":3128,"userID":322,"username":"Bara","subject":"","time":1448042001,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Um nur mal dich und allen anderen drauf aufmerksam zu machen, es gibt eine eigene Unter-Kategorie für Vorschläge. -&gt; <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?board/167-plugin-map-allgemeine-vorschl%C3%A4ge/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">PlugIn / Map / Allgemeine Vorschläge</a></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>2. Admin Fail</p>","polls":[]}]}